<li id="bib.bib15" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Li et al<span id="bib.bib15.2" class="ltx_text">.</span> (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
